      "message": "test(post): declare shared suite modules once and find script suites in script_goldens\n\nclippy::duplicate_mod refuses a file loaded as two modules of one binary:\nlegacy_program (script_dialects) and coincident_arcs/reader.rs\n(script_arcs) are now declared once in the suite's main.rs.\n\nevery_shipped_post_script_has_its_suite reads the script modules under\ntests/script_goldens/ and also checks that main.rs declares each one.\n\nRefs #3188\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
