      "message": "Merge upstream main into issue/3188-fold-post-sim-suites\n\nOne conflict, in crates/post/tests/script_goldens/script_heidenhain_klartext.rs.\nMain added the module klartext/cycle_tests.rs to the flat file. The fold moved\nthat file into the script_goldens suite. The two sides are kept: the new\nmodule is declared with the path ../klartext/cycle_tests.rs.\n\nRefs #3188\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
